<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ share market closed for bank holiday.</title>
<headline>NZ share market closed for bank holiday.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand share market was closed on Thursday for the Waitangi Day holiday.</p>
<p>The top 40 index closed 9.58 weaker on Wednesday at 2330.36.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
